  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Load the register Cluster 2 + this POML. INSPECT how a compose action's bindingId is meant to reach the toolbar (deterministic mirror id vs runtime resolution by consumer+action code) and how the 046 dispatch seam is wired. Confirm the admit-gate + dispatch plumbing are already correct (they are — E-20 landed). Enumerate which of the 5 actions have a trigger today vs not.</step>
