    <step order="4">Verify: dotnet build + dotnet test (084 + dispatch/compose regression); Compose.Components tsc + jest; if BFF source changed, publish-size + CVE (else state client+test only). Run Step 9.5 (code-review + adr-check) UNCONDITIONALLY. Update this POML notes. NAME task 047 (deploy) + the /healthz flip as owner-queued in your report. Do NOT edit TASK-INDEX/current-task (main session reconciles).</step>
  </steps>

